    "chunk_text": "& \u00e6\u00feered Wiltunscire biscop wear\u00fe gecoren to \u00e6rcebiscpe to Her cuom se here to Readingum on West Seaxe, & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb iii niht ridon ii eorlas up; \u00dea gemette hie \u00e6\u00feelwulf aldorman on Englafelda, & him \u00fe\u00e6r wi\u00fe gefeaht & sige nam; \u00de\u00e6s ymb iiii niht \u00e6\u00feered cyning & \u00e6lfred his bro\u00feur \u00fe\u00e6r micle fierd to Readingum gel\u00e6ddon, & & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb iiii niht gefeaht \u00e6\u00feered cyning & \u00e6lfred his bro\u00feur wi\u00fe alne \u00feone here on \u00e6scesdune, & & \u00fea gefeaht se cyning \u00e6\u00feered wi\u00fe \u00feara cyninga getruman, & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00fe se cyning Bagsecg & \u00e6lfred his bro\u00feur wi\u00fe \u00feara eorla getruman, & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00fe Sidroc eorl ofsl\u00e6gen se alda, & Sidroc & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb xiiii niht gefeaht \u00e6\u00feered cyning & \u00e6lfred his bro\u00f0ur wi\u00fe \u00feone here \u00e6t Basengum, & & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb ii mona\u00fe gefeaht \u00e6\u00feered cyning & \u00e6lfred his bro\u00feur wi\u00fe \u00feone here \u00e6t Meretune, & hie & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00fe Heahmund biscep ofsl\u00e6gen, & fela godra monna; & \u00e6fter \u00feissum gefeohte cuom \u00dea feng \u00e6lfred \u00e6\u00feelwulfing his bro\u00feur to Wesseaxna rice; & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb anne mona\u00fe gefeaht \u00e6lfred cyning wi\u00fe alne \u00feone here lytle werede \u00e6t Wiltune, & hine & \u00fe\u00e6s geares wurdon viiii folc gefeoht gefohten wi\u00fe \u00feone here on \u00fe",
